win32.cherry-studio:
Name: uoink. Transport: stdio. Enter these command, args and env values
in the client's separate fields. Each args element is one argument;
keep paths with spaces together. This is a field reference, not an import file.
{
  "command": "<PYTHON>",
  "args": [
    "<MCP>",
    "--isolated-profile",
    "<PROFILE>",
    "--isolated-port",
    "5187"
  ],
  "env": {
    "PYTHONIOENCODING": "utf-8",
    "PYTHONUTF8": "1"
  }
}

